        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Electricity, at wind power plant
The share of the used modules is based on the production in year 2002. Excluded is one 800kW plant near Andermatt, which was installed that year.;
UUID: a61f7b4e-2c3c-3367-97ba-53fc2feffb6b
Includes the modules of the 30kW, 150kW, 600kW, and 800kW wind plants for Switzerland.
Location: Swiss average data.
Technology: Average technology
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature and statistics. 
Extrapolations: none
